<title>USA: Camelot Corp nine month loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Camelot Corp nine month loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.26	    profit$0.01</p>
<p> Net loss	  6,149	    profit180</p>
<p> Revs		9,032		    3,922</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  23,529		   13,487</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine months ended Jan 31.</p>
<p>The company recorded charges of $291,143 and $56,000 in 1997 and 1196, respectively, as losses from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Camelot said it also had an unrealized loss on trading secruities of $6.6 million in the 1997 period/</p>
<p>The company said that in the final quarter it will record an extraordinary charge of $800,000 reflecting the closing of its six retail stores.</p>
